{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_4_level_main_04-04_beg","groupId":"main_4","stageId":"main_04-04","title":"不要恐慌","storyCode":"4-4","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_04-04_beg.txt","sourceHash":"22954628ad67ca608a86f0b33968830540c28d8bf22e725b0942f6958647aa33","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第三十二关（前）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_m"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"沒等太久吧。近衛局的會議稍微耽誤了點時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事的，陳長官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"（陳長官，就像什麼事都沒發生過一樣......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"情況如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島的偵查小隊已經提供了一些有效情報。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我總結了一下，從其中選了幾條你會感興趣的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......星熊警官......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"別在意。我也想稍微聽一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"繼續說吧，阿米婭，沒關係的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"好的。依據羅德島從部分感染者那裡得來的線索——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"偵查小隊已經查明了龍門平民區內整合運動的一部分窩點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"然後呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"有數支整合運動小隊正在謀劃針對龍門的防衛力量發動襲擊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我們甚至查到一個整合運動向內滲透的管道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，真是囂張。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"龍門近衛局被小看了呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"關於那個切爾諾伯格分城廢墟的呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島有數支偵查小隊正同時在分城執行任務。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"其中確實徘徊著許多整合運動的成員，而原本的居民基本都不知去向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"有一支小隊甚至與整合運動發生了三次以上戰鬥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，以目前的情報量而言，我們還不能斷定這個分城與整合運動的行動究竟有何聯繫......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"但我建議，將這座分城作為接下來的重點作戰目標之一。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......是嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"星熊，幫我去拿下報表。在我桌子左邊第三格抽屜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"現在？行。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你繼續說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，綜上所述......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島建議，應該發動一次聯合作戰，完全剿滅龍門內部的整合運動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"並不好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"近衛局不會允許的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......什麼？陳長官......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我說，不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你，是感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"再在貧民區內執行任務，只會引起更大的騷亂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"這是近衛局的決定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"可是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，稍等，我接一下......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡是阿米婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是，是阿米婭嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......！潔西卡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是的，這裡是潔西卡......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"是在進行什麼隱秘行動嗎，聲音這麼輕......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們在分城廢墟發現了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......整合運動的領袖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而且有......兩個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"喪家犬就這樣灰溜溜的跑回來了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"我可不屬於你們這種下等種族哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"——如果你不是成功完成了任務，我一定讓你這張臉上多添一兩道疤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"麻煩被炸的手足全失的小孩子用嘴來為我化妝，真過意不去呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"我們兩個鬥嘴——可是沒什麼好處的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"我姑且承認了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，魚上鉤了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"一定。就看愛國者那個老傢伙能不能把真貨帶回去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"說起來，你還挺怕這老頭的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"我心情已經有些不太好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"不過在釣上大魚之前，對吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"要嘛我們倆，就先相互忍耐一下吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"哼。是啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"我先得解決這些小的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島的幾位，出來吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"——想要在我面前隱藏自己，是絕對不可能的哦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"隕星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"潔西卡，別！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"隕星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"這可能是陷阱......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"他發現我們了！必須——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"如果擊倒敵人的領袖的話，我們......必須......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，果然在啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"是哪裡來的小貓咪呢~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡可不是讓你隨意玩耍的地方哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"是！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"——分食豐盛的獵物之前——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"先去嘗嘗小的吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"噢噢，噢噢噢！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜葉","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"呿！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米婭"]},{"speakerId":"char_010_chen","aliases":["陳"]},{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["整合運動成員"]},{"speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","aliases":["星熊"]},{"speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","aliases":["W"]},{"speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","aliases":["梅菲斯特"]},{"speakerId":"char_193_frostl","aliases":["霜葉"]},{"speakerId":"char_219_meteo","aliases":["隕星"]},{"speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","aliases":["潔西卡"]}]}
